DEL025: National
 
Crafts
 
Museum
 
A
 
specialized
 
cultural
 
museum
 
showcasing
 
traditional
 
Indian
 
folk
 
arts,
 
tribal
 
crafts,
 
and
 
rural
 
village
 
architecture.
 
The
 
campus
 
includes
 
open-air
 
courtyards
 
where
 
master
 
craftspeople
 
from
 
across
 
the
 
country
 
demonstrate
 
traditional
 
textile
 
weaving,
 
pottery,
 
block
 
printing,
 
and
 
wood
 
carving
